Package: clinChat
Type: Package
Title: Conversational Interfaces for Clinical Data with Large Language Models
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-22
Authors@R: person("Shekhar", "Chalwadi", email = "skrchalwadicg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools and Shiny applications for interacting with clinical
    datasets through natural language using large language models. Built on
    'ellmer' and 'shinychat', it emphasizes privacy-aware workflows where
    data remains local and only necessary summaries or tool results are
    shared with the model. Includes ready-to-use chat interfaces for
    exploratory analysis, summarization, and querying of clinical data.
